d in London and can make it, I'll organise one in central London.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you could also let me know which day of the week works best for you, that would be great too!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCheers!\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"Hi everyone, \r\n\r\nI recently saw a post about an NYC lobsters meetup, and am wondering how many people here could make it to a London meetup. \r\n\r\nIf more than a couple of people here are based in London and can make it, I'll organise one in central London. \r\n\r\nIf you could also let me know which day of the week works best for you, that would be great too! \r\n\r\nCheers!","submitter_user":"prole","user_is_author":true,"tags":["event"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/dsrruj","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/dsrruj/london_meetup"},{"short_id":"2matgw","created_at":"2026-10-29T15:33:44.663-05:00","title":"C2PA's eMudhra Moment","url":"https://www.da.vidbuchanan.co.uk/blog/c2pa-four.html","score":25,"flags":0,"comment_count":4,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"retr0id","user_is_author":true,"tags":["cryptography","security"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/2matgw","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/2matgw/c2pa_s_emudhra_moment"},{"short_id":"esit9r","created_at":"2026-10-29T14:00:39.252-05:00","title":"Cybersecurity Is About to Be the Biggest Problem in Tech","url":"https://projectautonomy.substack.com/p/cybersecurity-is-about-to-be-the","score":-1,"flags":4,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"lukewilson","user_is_author":true,"tags":["culture","security"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/esit9r","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/esit9r/cybersecurity_is_about_be_biggest"},{"short_id":"v7defp","created_at":"2026-10-29T13:14:51.675-05:00","title":"Uji - Gentoo of Coding Agents","url":"https://uji.sh","score":-4,"flags":8,"comment_count":3,"description":"\u003cp\u003eMy friend and I are Neovim nerds, and every so often our Neovim setups would throw errors. What did we do? We talked to each other and solved it. It was never Neovim’s fault.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe think the same way about harnesses. If you don’t like something, you shouldn’t have to call a trillion-dollar company; you should be able to fix it yourself. If you want something custom, you shouldn’t have to keep spamming some discussion thread; you should be able to write it yourself.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd more than anything, it should be simple and fast, and your computer shouldn’t scream OOM. That’s the inspiration behind uji.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI hope you all love it!!!\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"My friend and I are Neovim nerds, and every so often our Neovim setups would throw errors. What did we do? We talked to each other and solved it. It was never Neovim’s fault.\r\n\r\nWe think the same way about harnesses. If you don’t like something, you shouldn’t have to call a trillion-dollar company; you should be able to fix it yourself. If you want something custom, you shouldn’t have to keep spamming some discussion thread; you should be able to write it yourself.\r\n\r\nAnd more than anything, it should be simple and fast, and your computer shouldn’t scream OOM. That’s the inspiration behind uji.\r\n\r\nI hope you all love it!!!","submitter_user":"dracarys_18","user_is_author":false,"tags":["ai","lua","rust"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/v7defp","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/v7defp/uji_gentoo_coding_agents"},{"short_id":"siebde","created_at":"2026-10-29T11:32:18.607-05:00","title":"My favourite PowerMac is a Nintendo Wii","url":"https://virtuallyfun.com/2026/10/29/my-favourite-powermac-is-a-nintendo-wii/","score":48,"flags":0,"comment_count":1,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"ninakali","user_is_author":false,"tags":["retrocomputing","reversing"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/siebde","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/siebde/my_favourite_powe